  "_billets_doc": "WHAT EACH JOB IS CALLED AND WHO HOLDS IT. A rank LIST is drawn by hash, so the same billet is not the same rank in every platoon. `fromEnd` names the billets at the END of a kind's group — rosters are listed in casualty order, so the last leader standing is the platoon leader and the one before is the platoon sergeant. `fromStart` is the same from the other end. Crew billets are keyed by CREW SIZE ('*' = any size not named) and the last seat repeats.",
